  "source": "## Semantics: T6, T3, C3, K1, A1, A2, M0\ngrammar ConformanceZeroWidth version \"1.0.0\" mode \"v1\" {\n  ## A presence marker recorded before a letter run.\n  main = \"\" as present 1*%x61-7A\n\n  entry main: main\n\n  test main {\n    accept \"a\"\n    capture \"abc\" { present: \"\" }\n    reject \"1\"\n  }\n}\n",
